After #5811, ordinary legacy requests can use HTTP/2 through `Dispatcher1Wrapper`. The HTTP/2 controller supplies `rawHeaders` / `rawTrailers` as objects; `LegacyHandlerWrapper` currently forwards them unchanged because they are non-null. Legacy `onHeaders`, `onComplete`, and `onUpgrade` expect raw header arrays.

